'''Blaine''' (Japanese: '''カツラ''' ''Katsura'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During this turn, attacks used by your {{TCGP|Ninetales}}, {{TCGP|Rapidash}}, or {{TCGP|Magmar}} do +30 damage to your opponent's Active Pokémon.
}}

